  "properties": {
    "title": "West Africa Coastal Vulnerability Mapping: Subset of OpenStreetMap (OSM) Roads",
    "description": "The West Africa Coastal Vulnerability Mapping: Subset of OpenStreetMap (OSM) Roads data set includes roads within 200 kilometers of the coast and was extracted from the full OSM data set in March 2014. OSM is a global crowdsourced road and street map and is continually being updated.",
